==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Claydol|33}} from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
*{{m|Heal Block}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Claydol}} can learn.
*'''Power Beam''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Double Crisis|Team Magma's Claydol|11}} from the {{TCG|Double Crisis}} special set.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

